; Rotary top touch: o<ferrum_rotary_top> call [A] [span]. Turns A to [A]
; (absolute, at the current height, feed #3017), then touches down with
; o<ferrum_touch> for up to min([span], #3020). Returns the probed Z (tip
; bottom, current work coordinates) in #<_value>; the probe is left where
; ferrum_touch leaves it, above the surface.
o<ferrum_rotary_top> sub
G90 G1 A#1 F#3017
#<span> = #2
o100 if [#<span> GT #3020]
    #<span> = #3020
o100 endif
o<ferrum_touch> call [2] [-1] [#<span>]
G90
o<ferrum_rotary_top> endsub [#<_ferrum_hit>]
M2
